---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <div class="brand-logo">
          <img src="/images/official_user_logo.png" alt="Candy Factory Coworking Logo" style="height: 60px; width: auto; border-radius: 8px;">
        </div>
        <p>Denver's historic confectionery building transformed into a boutique coworking space for forward-thinking professionals and creative teams.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Workspace Tiers</h4>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="#spaces">Day Pass ($25/day)</a>
          <a href="#spaces">Hot Desk Membership</a>
          <a href="#spaces">Dedicated Desks ($500/mo)</a>
          <a href="#spaces">Private Office Suites ($807+/mo)</a>
          <a href="#spaces">Conference Room Rentals</a>
          <a href="#spaces">Event Space Rental</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Quick Links</h4>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="#matcher">Workspace Matcher</a>
          <a href="#amenities">Building Amenities</a>
          <a href="#history">Historic Baur's Story</a>
          <a href="#testimonials">Member Reviews</a>
          <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Contact & Location</h4>
        <div class="footer-contact-item">
          <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
          <span>1514 Curtis Street, Suite 200<br>Denver, CO 80202</span>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-contact-item">
          <i class="fas fa-phone"></i>
          <span>(302) 521-9500</span>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-contact-item">
          <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
          <span>jose@candyfactorycoworking.com</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>&copy; 2026 Candy Factory Coworking. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Built with ❤️ for Denver's Creative & Professional Community.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
.site-footer {
  background: #001525;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  padding-top: 4.5rem;
  padding-bottom: 2rem;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
}

.footer-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;
  gap: 3rem;
  margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
}

.footer-brand {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.2rem;
}

.footer-brand p {
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.footer-col h4 {
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  position: relative;
  padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.footer-col h4::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 25px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--primary-red);
}

.footer-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.75rem;
}

.footer-links a {
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.footer-links a:hover {
  color: #FFFFFF;
  padding-left: 4px;
}

.footer-contact-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.footer-contact-item i {
  color: var(--primary-red);
  margin-top: 0.2rem;
}

.footer-bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  padding-top: 2rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .footer-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .footer-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
